 "texts": [
  {
   "text": "The water is scalding",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 0.3,
   "t1": 4.7
  },
  {
   "text": "He feels nothing",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 5.15,
   "t1": 9.549
  },
  {
   "text": "Father Damien",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 9.999,
   "t1": 14.84
  },
  {
   "text": "Eleven years in Kalaupapa",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 15.29,
   "t1": 20.132
  },
  {
   "text": "Kalaupapa, Molokai \u2014 1884",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 20.582,
   "t1": 25.423
  },
  {
   "text": "\"We lepers\"",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 25.873,
   "t1": 32.923
  },
  {
   "text": "LEPROSY",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 330,
   "size": 130,
   "style": "title",
   "pop": true,
   "t0": 39.369,
   "t1": 43.569
  },
  {
   "text": "THE OLDEST STIGMA",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 470,
   "size": 72,
   "style": "title",
   "color": [
    180,
    205,
    225
   ],
   "t0": 39.719,
   "t1": 43.619
  },
  {
   "text": "Gerhard Armauer Hansen, 1873",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 53.259,
   "t1": 61.949
  },
  {
   "text": "He still won't grow in a lab",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 68.193,
   "t1": 73.537
  },
  {
   "text": "The coolest parts of the body",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 73.987,
   "t1": 84.639
  },
  {
   "text": "About 95% are naturally immune",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 90.003,
   "t1": 94.016
  },
  {
   "text": "Months of close contact",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 94.466,
   "t1": 98.479
  },
  {
   "text": "Most people never get sick",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 98.929,
   "t1": 102.942
  },
  {
   "text": "He travelled with us",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 117.147,
   "t1": 124.155
  },
  {
   "text": "India, 4,000 years ago",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 124.605,
   "t1": 131.614
  },
  {
   "text": "Armadillos in the American South",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 139.9,
   "t1": 145.736
  },
  {
   "text": "Even red squirrels in Britain",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 146.186,
   "t1": 152.022
  },
  {
   "text": "What He Does to You",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 150,
   "size": 72,
   "t0": 157.819,
   "t1": 162.929
  },
  {
   "text": "A patch you can barely feel",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 157.819,
   "t1": 162.929
  },
  {
   "text": "Eyes closed: can you feel this?",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 163.379,
   "t1": 168.489
  },
  {
   "text": "He attacks the nerves",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 168.939,
   "t1": 171.836
  },
  {
   "text": "Burns you never feel",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 172.286,
   "t1": 175.183
  },
  {
   "text": "Wounds you don't notice",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 175.633,
   "t1": 178.53
  },
  {
   "text": "Fingers don't just fall off",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 178.98,
   "t1": 193.089
  },
  {
   "text": "Eyes, hands and feet",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 193.539,
   "t1": 203.405
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, your place among people",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 203.855,
   "t1": 211.378
  },
  {
   "text": "Sushruta, ancient India",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 218.002,
   "t1": 221.422
  },
  {
   "text": "Chaulmoogra oil",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 221.872,
   "t1": 225.292
  },
  {
   "text": "Tzaraat: many diseases, one fear",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 229.612,
   "t1": 241.242
  },
  {
   "text": "A lazar house outside the walls",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 248.405,
   "t1": 251.172
  },
  {
   "text": "Thousands of them",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 251.622,
   "t1": 254.388
  },
  {
   "text": "Cared for, but kept apart",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 254.838,
   "t1": 257.605
  },
  {
   "text": "A ceremony like a funeral",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 258.055,
   "t1": 261.877
  },
  {
   "text": "Cloak, gloves, clapper, bowl",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 262.327,
   "t1": 266.148
  },
  {
   "text": "A clapper to warn people",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 266.598,
   "t1": 270.42
  },
  {
   "text": "Not allowed to touch the food",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 270.87,
   "t1": 278.625
  },
  {
   "text": "He felt no pain",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 285.739,
   "t1": 289.602
  },
  {
   "text": "Baldwin IV, king at 13",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 290.052,
   "t1": 293.916
  },
  {
   "text": "Montgisard, 1177",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 294.366,
   "t1": 298.229
  },
  {
   "text": "Victory at sixteen",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 298.679,
   "t1": 302.542
  },
  {
   "text": "He faded from Europe",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 302.992,
   "t1": 309.527
  },
  {
   "text": "Empty leper houses",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 309.977,
   "t1": 316.513
  },
  {
   "text": "Bergen, Norway",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 321.943,
   "t1": 325.823
  },
  {
   "text": "The world's first patient register",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 326.273,
   "t1": 330.154
  },
  {
   "text": "Tiny rods, 1873",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 334.934,
   "t1": 340.14
  },
  {
   "text": "A germ, not a curse",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 340.59,
   "t1": 345.795
  },
  {
   "text": "Taken to court, 1880",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 346.245,
   "t1": 357.954
  },
  {
   "text": "Honolulu, 1866",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 364.386,
   "t1": 369.344
  },
  {
   "text": "About 8,000 people sent to Kalaupapa",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 369.794,
   "t1": 374.752
  },
  {
   "text": "A one-way journey",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 375.202,
   "t1": 380.16
  },
  {
   "text": "He built houses and a church",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 380.61,
   "t1": 385.982
  },
  {
   "text": "Father Damien, died 1889",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 386.432,
   "t1": 391.803
  },
  {
   "text": "Alice Ball, 1915",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 398.17,
   "t1": 403.315
  },
  {
   "text": "Oil you could inject",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 403.765,
   "t1": 408.911
  },
  {
   "text": "Someone else took the credit",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 414.956,
   "t1": 424.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Carville, Louisiana",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 424.95,
   "t1": 429.632
  },
  {
   "text": "Promin, 1941",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 430.082,
   "t1": 434.764
  },
  {
   "text": "The Miracle at Carville",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 435.214,
   "t1": 439.896
  },
  {
   "text": "Three drugs together, 1981",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 440.346,
   "t1": 446.359
  },
  {
   "text": "Millions cured",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 446.809,
   "t1": 452.822
  },
  {
   "text": "What He Leaves Behind",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 150,
   "size": 72,
   "t0": 458.74,
   "t1": 464.171
  },
  {
   "text": "Checking for injuries every day",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 458.74,
   "t1": 464.171
  },
  {
   "text": "Numb hands and feet",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 464.621,
   "t1": 470.052
  },
  {
   "text": "Japan ended isolation only in 1996",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 470.502,
   "t1": 477.26
  },
  {
   "text": "'Leper' came to mean outcast",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 477.71,
   "t1": 484.467
  },
  {
   "text": "About 200,000 new cases a year",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 490.446,
   "t1": 493.068
  },
  {
   "text": "Brazil, Indonesia, India",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 493.518,
   "t1": 496.14
  },
  {
   "text": "More than half in India",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 496.59,
   "t1": 499.212
  },
  {
   "text": "Treatment is free",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 499.662,
   "t1": 508.049
  },
  {
   "text": "NEXT TIME",
   "x": 1380,
   "y": 360,
   "size": 110,
   "style": "title",
   "pop": true,
   "t0": 535.086,
   "t1": 539.686
  },
